<title>GEORGIA: Georgian December inflation slows to 0.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Georgian December inflation slows to 0.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TBILISI 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Georgia's monthly consumer price inflation was 0.7 percent in December after 1.1 percent in November, the Department for Social and Economic Information said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    GEORGIAN CONSUMER PRICES   DEC 96    NOV 96    DEC 95</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change	  +0.7	+1.1	+3.4</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change	   +13.5     +16.6    +157.4</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
